(text "v0.5: J1 = JST GH 1.25 mm 8P side entry (SM08B-GHS-TB), harness W-2 to M12 8P; J5 chassis spring contact (was M12 shell pin)." (at 30.48 209.296 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 25cb4657-7c64-5697-93c3-7d625ea7215c))
(text "v0.4: J3 = JST SH 1.0 mm 4P (SM04B-SRSS-TB side entry, v0.5) for sensor harness W-1 direct from HTX99R (no feedthrough, mech Rev F); Pt1000 2-wire (Kelvin split at J3 pads)." (at 30.48 214.884 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c4209203-4276-5605-becd-bf8b3acbeb3c))
(text "v0.3: MCU STM32G0B1CCT3 (LQFP48, -40..125 C, in-house part); TPS26600PWP official pinout; single axial PCB 57x23 (mech Rev C)." (at 30.48 220.472 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c9849e73-29ca-5ed7-b496-3ce0d012fd8c))
(text "Signal flow: J1 field connector -> protection -> eFuse -> 5 V buck -> 3.3 V LDO; sensor head J3 -> PCAP04 / ADS1220 -> MCU -> DAC8760 x2 / THVD2450 -> J1" (at 30.48 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f81220da-233e-59a6-9404-ce8244e9c80d))
(text "Outputs: RS-485 Modbus RTU + 2x analog (4-20 mA / 0-20 mA / 0-10 V / 0-5 V selectable).  Supply 12-28 V DC." (at 30.48 231.648 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ee99cd3a-917c-5817-ae28-79f99d02824c))
(text "Protection target: any pin pair +/-30 V continuous (miswiring), surge +/-1 kV, ESD +/-8 kV contact." (at 30.48 237.236 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 16811ae8-69b7-50e3-8bc5-1be1543d9739))
(text "Power symbols: GND, +3V3, +3V3A (analog 3.3 V), +5V, VIN_P (protected input), CHASSIS.  Inter-sheet signals: global labels." (at 30.48 242.824 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c78f7876-1536-595c-9cac-5cf81555b7e3))
(text "v0.6: parts cleanup (-16: pull-ups R11-15, LED D3/R16, RS-485 R60/61 D60/61, FB2 C19 C11 C2 C6); PCB temperature = ADS1220 + MCU internal sensors." (at 30.48 248.412 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 879b047e-df8f-51f9-8d65-4809faed8586))
(text "v0.7: DAC8760 datasheet pinout (HTSSOP-24 PWP); +VSENSE via OPA197 follower (U12/U13); external ISET-R 15k 0.1%; DACs on SPI2 daisy chain, common DAC_LATCH." (at 30.48 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 472f16e4-96a8-57a4-926e-fbf88ea57617))
(text "v0.8: datasheet review (docs/hw/schematic-review-260313A.md): real pinouts LMR36006/PCAP04/TPS26611; TPS2660 RTN isolated from GND; OVP 29 V (supply 12-28 V);" (at 30.48 259.588 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8794cc83-d2dc-551b-a28c-527759e549f9))
(text "      DAC SPI = gated SCLK (daisy chain removed in DAC8760 rev D); DAC AVDD 10R; ALARM wired-OR + 10k; TVS3301 outputs; PCAP04 on SPI3; buck L/C per datasheet." (at 30.48 265.176 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2daf6dfc-f2d2-5db4-bfb5-4f933c9cf81b))
(text "Footprints: KiCad 7.0.11 library + project library HMT500_260313A (LMR36006 RNX0012A, GDT Bourns 2035-xx-SM, TVS3301 pad floating)." (at 30.48 270.764 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 36493700-5f7f-50af-9073-c1528b0d7336))
(text "표기 규칙: 부품번호 = 굵은 글자 (R1, U4) / 부품값 = 보통 글자 (10k, DAC8760) / 전원 네트 = 기울인 글자 (+3V3, VIN_P)" (at 30.48 276.352 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc9d3a9b-504e-51d0-8f1e-b801728257ef))
(text "         신호 네트 = 테두리 있는 라벨 (SPI_SCK, OUT1_EXT) - 네트 이름은 부품번호·부품명과 겹치지 않게 지음" (at 30.48 281.94 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d15d9703-ed22-5bc6-982b-e99c056c3c60))
(text "         라벨 모양 = 신호 방향: 뾰족한 쪽이 밖 = 이 시트에서 내보냄(출력), 안 = 받음(입력), 양쪽 = 양방향, 네모 = 아날로그·수동" (at 30.48 287.528 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 36bfd9ed-f3ef-53f8-9ada-56a728deb20d))
(text "글자 겹침: 생성기가 부품 몸체·핀·선·라벨·메모와 겹치지 않는 자리에 자동 배치하고, 겹치면 생성 실패로 처리" (at 30.48 293.116 0) (effects (font (face "NanumGothic") (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 522b9b95-3489-531b-9f0a-ec60169d6ed7))
